# Content is an allowlist: only the project's own folders are uploaded. Everything else under Content/ is third-party
# (Fab/Marketplace packs, Epic template content) or per-user (Developers, Collections) and stays local, so a newly
# downloaded pack can never end up in this public repo by accident. See README.md for the packs collaborators need.
Content/*
!Content/Blockout/
!Content/Maps/
!Content/Python/
!Content/StarfallCrater/
!Content/__ExternalActors__/
!Content/__ExternalObjects__/
!Content/azrothreborn.umap
!Content/azrothreborn_HLOD0_Instancing.uasset
